Hanvon ROM platform interfaces
------------------------------
The declarations in framework-stubs describe interfaces supplied by the
target Hanvon device ROM. They are compile-only external platform interfaces
and are not included in the BetterHvNote distribution. Recovered ROM native
binaries are explicitly excluded from the APK.

